msgid "http://www.never5.com/"
msgstr "http://www.never5.com/"

#. translators: 1: required PHP version, 2: required WordPress version
#: related-posts-for-wp.php:66
msgid "Related Posts for WordPress needs PHP %1$s and WordPress %2$s or newer. It does not run on this site until they are updated."
msgstr "Related Posts for WordPress захтева PHP %1$s и WordPress %2$s или новији. Додатак неће радити на овом веб месту док се они не ажурирају."

#. translators: 1: link opening tag, 2: link closing tag
#: related-posts-for-wp.php:89
msgid "Related Posts for WordPress 3.0 works together with Related Posts for WordPress Premium 3.0. Please %1$supdate Premium%2$s. Until then, your current version of Premium keeps working on its own."
msgstr "Related Posts for WordPress 3.0 ради заједно са Related Posts for WordPress Premium 3.0. %1$sАжурирајте Premium%2$s. До тада ваше тренутно издање додатка Premium наставља да ради самостално."

#: src/Admin/App/Assets.php:104
msgid "The settings screen of Related Posts for WordPress is missing its scripts. Run npm run build in the plugin folder."
msgstr "Екрану подешавања додатка Related Posts for WordPress недостају скрипте. Покрените npm run build у фасцикли додатка."

